{"login": "ahanapradhan", "location": "India", "commits": [{"sha": "5e516c5800ddb3f0833c23a8e8802698c92a2d52", "message": "example from other paper", "created_at": "2020-07-30T04:21:28Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cc327b408e0437b8f71279d4eb903f93db6a88b3", "message": "bug fix in folding\n\nfirst fold single-in multi-out\nthen fold single-in-out\n\ndiamondnet was causing problem\n\nthis example is taken from Fig 4. file:///Users/ahanapradhan/Desktop/PN_reduction/15027.pdf", "created_at": "2020-07-27T05:59:06Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "08f5368652a0dc8e5480724da33f7e877c39f26c", "message": "marking generation optimization\n\ngenerate sub markings for a node (take any place from it and generate concurrenct submarking for it)\n\nReuse the same submarking for all the places in this node to produce respective concurrent marking\n\n** optimizes the calculation of repeated computation of GCS, since all places in a node has the same GCS tree", "created_at": "2020-07-27T04:25:41Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b37336163dc4be2a6648ee50009e12ab06466151", "message": "bugfix in GCS.\n\nsample net added for which the bug was produced", "created_at": "2020-07-26T17:48:28Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "953a4f82e95a92706c2804f1bf80ee891f42989d", "message": "testcases\n\nexperimenting with loop and concurrency mixture.", "created_at": "2020-07-20T15:10:39Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d2ff0349649e480d3faf446438a7c4e10200d33e", "message": "marking generation and test", "created_at": "2020-07-17T17:05:56Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d573e7830e19766afa1323c7e9ab5ed6e6f8fc4c", "message": "debug GCS", "created_at": "2020-07-16T12:18:55Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d8caad32832b95bedd0f4fc3fbfe50ff8567b3da", "message": "started fixing getGCS for unstructured tree\n\nNow C-tree is actually a graph.\nHave to define GCS corrently for this.\nFix started for getGCS", "created_at": "2020-07-13T12:34:01Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f16d87342bc35247b0089ed43ec678ac0552998a", "message": "Delete DebugTest.java", "created_at": "2020-07-11T10:25:08Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "48539978464d91c873fc1a143a6a028563ed268c", "message": "bug-fix in structured net folding", "created_at": "2020-07-11T10:24:37Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "00461705898e6bd4e8976f035f2de85fc0a275d5", "message": "GCSUtils debug\n\nfew testcases verified.\nStill debugging.", "created_at": "2020-07-11T10:00:35Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8cd5262309104f9acc8330e6bfbc74938dd92c0e", "message": "utils interface", "created_at": "2020-07-09T13:14:12Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae2dfb0008a2df19f3bf515313606019e5be3cc6", "message": "deleted ECWS part\n\nTo generate Ctree from a net, translating to ECWS is not required.\nnet folding is a superior technique.\n\nAlso, with unstructured net, net folding can fold the structured portions leaving out the unstructured portions.\nGCS has to be updated to handle such a folded structure to generate markings.", "created_at": "2020-07-09T13:07:49Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ed68536421d38ec8f3442286793463bd04f132b5", "message": "net to ctree convert and rendering", "created_at": "2020-07-08T13:28:27Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43f917b4695e1ca8424b3172c28a5964d552a44b", "message": "test cases\n\nchecked if folding is happening properly even if net has unstructured construct.\n\nverified: able to fold structured part and all single token region properly.", "created_at": "2020-07-07T15:49:51Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4d15d16df1d1d8ffc743d39202e9b59b4b53a8b3", "message": "AND folding bug-fix", "created_at": "2020-07-07T09:23:43Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "234e2c4ebf43f8548bb65bce24f9829f5e8ac02a", "message": "replace multi-in-out transitions with sequence of AND-fork place and AND-join", "created_at": "2020-07-07T01:17:23Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0c8ca1215ee64fc37d51013711646589ddfdd1fa", "message": "strctured ANDfork ANDjoin handled\n\nremoved only folding label related stuff. Netfolder now has only place folding, not label folding.\n\nCode now handles structured AND (for join separate transitions).", "created_at": "2020-07-05T01:25:05Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "51eabd9e01cac2870fcaa4c1eb502d17ddb774b3", "message": "testcases fix", "created_at": "2020-07-02T14:55:32Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "568b8d55af5c37c37793a49a8af087c02df5157b", "message": "rename singleInOut transition folding methods", "created_at": "2020-07-02T13:15:26Z", "repo": "Ctree", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "03e59fd8e435e5d6c08f4d859f9ff7fd91d1ec83", "message": "xor and loop folding final version\n\ntested for many cases\nNetTest has one testcase finalized written\nother tests not copied to this file